WEBVTT

00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:20.680
By the way, Zef, are you okay?

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:24.140
I've recovered!

00:00:28.940 --> 00:00:30.980
I am glad for you.

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:40.240
Thank you.

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:46.080
Now, since I've come this far, would you
folks mind taking Tact back to town?

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:49.170
I have something I need
to do on the sixth level.

00:00:49.170 --> 00:00:56.340
The sixth level? I heard there's
some big castle or temple there...

00:00:56.340 --> 00:00:59.510
That's the place. I have something
to do in that castle.

00:00:59.510 --> 00:01:03.310
Thousands of people should have
gone exploring there already,

00:01:03.310 --> 00:01:05.730
but word was that they found nothing.

00:01:07.850 --> 00:01:11.860
Hey, Mira. Can we come along, too?

00:01:11.860 --> 00:01:15.700
That's right. It's a place where
you have something to do.

00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:17.950
There may be something interesting.

00:01:17.950 --> 00:01:22.080
No, wait! There's no knowing
what danger may lurk down there.

00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:26.920
Heh! There's nowhere safer in this
dungeon than by your side, little miss.

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:28.420
I want to go see it, too!

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:32.710
I'll follow you wherever you go, Mira!

00:01:32.710 --> 00:01:34.760
You lot...

00:01:36.340 --> 00:01:41.930
Well, I want to be with these folks
a little longer as well, so...

00:01:44.850 --> 00:01:46.350
Follow me.

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:52.480
No matter what you do,
do not stray from my side.

00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:30.540
"Episode 4
'I'm At My Limit!'"

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:35.290
"Episode 4
'I'm At My Limit!'"
That reminds me, Mira. It sounded
like you said "Howard" earlier...

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:41.510
Hey, Howard. This is the holy water
that you loved. Come on out!

00:03:43.300 --> 00:03:45.140
An old acquaintance of mine.

00:03:45.140 --> 00:03:49.970
I wanted to ask him something,
but it seems our bond was lacking.

00:03:49.970 --> 00:03:53.600
Is he, by any chance, an old man
whose trademark outfit

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:55.650
consists of a trench coat and capotain?

00:03:56.060 --> 00:03:57.690
"Howard"

00:03:58.020 --> 00:04:00.320
What's this? You know him?

00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:03.780
So it is that old man Howard!

00:04:03.780 --> 00:04:07.080
You know that self-proclaimed
demon expert?

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:09.910
I wouldn't say I know him, but...

00:04:09.910 --> 00:04:14.920
Long ago, in the Lion King's Lair, out of
nowhere, he splashed holy water on me.

00:04:14.920 --> 00:04:19.880
You, as well? I see he splashed it on
anyone and everyone he could.

00:04:19.880 --> 00:04:23.680
You wanted to see that old man...

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:29.760
Oh, any chance it's related to the recent
appearance of that Lesser Demon?

00:04:29.760 --> 00:04:33.270
Well, I won't say it's not.

00:04:33.270 --> 00:04:37.650
I've heard that it's also
recently appeared near Alcait.

00:04:37.650 --> 00:04:40.400
Also? It's appeared elsewhere?

00:04:40.400 --> 00:04:43.360
In the past week, demon
sightings have been reported

00:04:43.360 --> 00:04:46.240
in three kingdoms, including Alcait.

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:49.080
I think there's likely to be
an advisory warning issued

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:51.240
to ordinary adventurers
in the near future as well.

00:04:51.240 --> 00:04:53.750
I see...

00:04:53.750 --> 00:04:57.500
So the appearance of the demons
isn't random after all,

00:04:57.500 --> 00:04:59.710
and there's some objective to it.

00:05:00.710 --> 00:05:02.840
What's wrong, Mira?

00:05:02.840 --> 00:05:05.510
Oh, it's nothing.

00:05:05.510 --> 00:05:09.140
Oh, no, the call of nature...

00:05:09.140 --> 00:05:11.390
Mira's holy water!

00:05:11.390 --> 00:05:17.270
Mira, holy water... Mira and...
Mira and holy water!

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:23.320
It's because of that
odd outburst of hers...

00:05:24.820 --> 00:05:28.740
Whew. We've arrived.

00:05:28.740 --> 00:05:31.200
Oh-ho, so this is it.

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:34.750
I'd heard of it,
but it's really something.

00:05:34.750 --> 00:05:40.040
It really is! I can hardly believe that
we're deep underground here.

00:05:40.960 --> 00:05:43.250
Oh, Mira! Wait!

00:05:46.970 --> 00:05:49.640
Wow, the inside is huge, too!

00:05:49.640 --> 00:05:53.430
But this place really is
as empty as can be.

00:05:53.430 --> 00:05:57.560
Mira, what on earth did you
come to this place for?

00:06:07.950 --> 00:06:10.370
A hidden door!

00:06:10.370 --> 00:06:13.370
Considering how cleverly it was hidden,

00:06:13.370 --> 00:06:16.540
I guess it's no wonder
no one noticed it before.

00:06:16.540 --> 00:06:19.000
And with one look, she saw it...

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:20.960
Mira really is amazing!

00:06:20.960 --> 00:06:23.000
Wait, all of you.

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:28.590
Let me go on from here alone.
It's a bit of a secret errand.

00:06:28.590 --> 00:06:30.720
Oh, really?

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:32.600
If you say so, Mira...

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:34.970
M-Mira's secret...

00:06:34.970 --> 00:06:37.310
Secret? No way--

00:06:40.350 --> 00:06:42.360
Sorry, please look after Tact for me.

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:45.320
Y-Yes, all right.

00:06:45.320 --> 00:06:48.110
Miss Mira, see you later!

00:06:48.110 --> 00:06:50.610
Yes. I'll go now.

00:06:57.410 --> 00:06:58.330
Not good!

00:06:58.330 --> 00:07:00.960
I'm at my limit!

00:07:01.830 --> 00:07:03.340
Oh, there it is!

00:07:07.210 --> 00:07:11.630
This is awkward,
but you can't fight necessity.

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:30.490
Immortal Arts: Biometric Scan.

00:07:32.660 --> 00:07:38.120
Mm-hm. They're all being
good and waiting there.

00:07:38.120 --> 00:07:39.700
However...

00:07:39.700 --> 00:07:43.330
There's no reading that
could be Soul Howl nearby.

00:07:43.330 --> 00:07:46.670
It seems I will have to go
to the top floor after all.

00:07:58.560 --> 00:08:00.560
Hm? This is...

00:08:00.560 --> 00:08:05.310
This reading is awfully weak
to be him, but...

00:08:05.310 --> 00:08:07.020
Could it be...?

00:08:12.570 --> 00:08:15.490
This is the throne room...

00:08:23.580 --> 00:08:26.630
No life to them already...

00:08:26.630 --> 00:08:31.670
It seems like Soul Howl is
becoming even more perverted.

00:08:31.670 --> 00:08:32.720
But...

00:08:32.720 --> 00:08:36.260
Given that a life sign
was detected in here...

00:08:42.310 --> 00:08:46.400
So cold... but she isn't dead.

00:08:46.400 --> 00:08:49.860
So, the life sign was this girl.

00:08:49.860 --> 00:08:52.940
Why is just this girl alive?

00:08:54.820 --> 00:08:56.700
Soul Howl!

00:08:56.700 --> 00:08:58.370
Are you not here?

00:08:59.490 --> 00:09:03.960
What the hell is he thinking?

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:10.710
So, this is his research laboratory.

00:09:11.760 --> 00:09:13.340
Ah-ha.

00:09:14.760 --> 00:09:17.260
This is great.

00:09:17.260 --> 00:09:22.310
Going way back, I could never
understand his proclivities,

00:09:22.310 --> 00:09:26.770
but what we did have in
common was our taste in clothes.

00:09:27.850 --> 00:09:32.980
With this many, my pilfering an outfit
or two shouldn't cause any problems.

00:09:36.650 --> 00:09:41.120
Hmm, I should have known.
They're all too big.

00:09:41.120 --> 00:09:41.990
In that case!

00:09:41.990 --> 00:09:44.160
If I just put on the top...

00:09:44.160 --> 00:09:48.000
Oh, I'm even more attractive!

00:09:50.380 --> 00:09:54.590
This would ruin my dignity as a summoner.

00:09:54.590 --> 00:09:58.090
It can't be helped. I'll give up
on changing clothes.

00:09:59.260 --> 00:10:02.890
Oops, these are precious...

00:10:02.890 --> 00:10:06.140
I couldn't bear to see them languish here.

00:10:06.140 --> 00:10:09.770
I think I will borrow these for a bit.

00:10:09.770 --> 00:10:10.980
This is...

00:10:10.980 --> 00:10:13.820
The Holy Grail of Heavenly Light.

00:10:13.820 --> 00:10:18.660
It's a legendary item that heals
any wound and helps people recover

00:10:18.660 --> 00:10:22.870
from all kinds of status effects,
and it's even said to cure death...

00:10:25.620 --> 00:10:28.870
Sorry, excuse me for a moment.

00:10:29.870 --> 00:10:31.960
I thought so...

00:10:31.960 --> 00:10:33.960
Demon's Blessing.

00:10:33.960 --> 00:10:39.840
So that's it. In order to
break the curse on this girl,

00:10:39.840 --> 00:10:42.100
Soul Howl stopped time with necromancy

00:10:42.100 --> 00:10:46.430
to buy time to obtain
the Holy Grail of Heavenly Light.

00:10:48.850 --> 00:10:53.610
I see... For that Soul Howl
to be doing this...

00:10:56.110 --> 00:10:59.030
There's no saving that girl now.

00:10:59.030 --> 00:11:02.870
Won't you mourn her along with her family?

00:11:02.870 --> 00:11:04.740
What are you saying, old one?

00:11:04.740 --> 00:11:07.330
To bury a beautiful woman
and return her to the soil

00:11:07.330 --> 00:11:09.580
would be a blasphemy against beauty.

00:11:09.580 --> 00:11:14.540
I will carefully embalm her
and store her with care.

00:11:14.540 --> 00:11:17.800
Thus, the beauty of
this girl will be eternal.

00:11:17.800 --> 00:11:24.550
Never to be sullied or touched
by old age, she will shine forever.

00:11:26.470 --> 00:11:31.390
To think that sick bastard would go
to these lengths for a living girl...

00:11:31.390 --> 00:11:35.110
I suppose it means that he
has changed a little as well.

00:11:45.200 --> 00:11:48.290
What is the matter with all of you?

00:11:48.290 --> 00:11:50.160
Oh, welcome back.

00:11:50.160 --> 00:11:52.920
Welcome back, Miss Mira!

00:11:52.920 --> 00:11:56.460
I'm back! Did you behave yourself?

00:11:56.460 --> 00:11:58.510
So, what happened?

00:11:58.510 --> 00:12:03.260
Mira! What is this place? I thought
there wasn't supposed to be anything!

00:12:03.260 --> 00:12:07.680
Dead maids... there are a lot of maids...

00:12:07.680 --> 00:12:09.970
No way...

00:12:09.970 --> 00:12:12.890
He had them hidden here as well?

00:12:12.890 --> 00:12:17.650
Soul Howl... He truly is sick to the core.

00:12:20.490 --> 00:12:22.490
Did something move just now?

00:12:22.490 --> 00:12:28.370
Aren't you mistaken? Many adventurers
have explored here before,

00:12:28.370 --> 00:12:31.790
but there've been no signs of
living things, let alone monsters.

00:12:31.790 --> 00:12:35.710
No, wait.
There's definitely something here.

00:12:37.540 --> 00:12:38.960
It's coming!

00:12:42.670 --> 00:12:43.970
A demon?!

00:12:43.970 --> 00:12:45.260
No way!

00:12:46.260 --> 00:12:51.140
Oh... to see people in such a place...

00:12:51.140 --> 00:12:55.980
What unexpected good luck.
You will make a fine offering.

00:12:55.980 --> 00:12:59.360
Tact, go hide for a while.

00:13:02.360 --> 00:13:05.320
Hm, so he's a third-ranked count.

00:13:05.320 --> 00:13:08.410
What do you all say?
Think you can fight him?

00:13:08.410 --> 00:13:12.450
If you mean as equals,
that's probably not happening.

00:13:12.450 --> 00:13:16.170
If we're prepared to make some sacrifices,
is more where we're at.

00:13:16.170 --> 00:13:18.590
I see, if that's the case...

00:13:18.590 --> 00:13:22.050
You all get back as well.
I'll deal with him.

00:13:22.050 --> 00:13:24.090
But the other guy is a demon!

00:13:24.090 --> 00:13:26.430
Even you couldn't take him alone!

00:13:26.430 --> 00:13:31.560
If you're summoning that Valkyrie,
we could at least buy you time until then.

00:13:31.560 --> 00:13:34.480
I'm sorry, but it doesn't look
like there'll be time for that.

00:13:47.740 --> 00:13:50.200
Everyone, let's leave this to Mira!

00:13:50.200 --> 00:13:52.660
But...

00:13:52.660 --> 00:13:56.750
Mira can't give it her
all if we're nearby!

00:14:01.880 --> 00:14:04.380
Can't be.

00:14:04.380 --> 00:14:08.220
Oh-ho, you parried a blow from my scythe.

00:14:08.220 --> 00:14:13.310
First, let me introduce myself
in honor of that ability.

00:14:13.310 --> 00:14:19.270
My name is Wolf Bane,
Soul Taker of Valnares.

00:14:19.270 --> 00:14:23.650
I am Mira. As you see, I am a summoner.

00:14:25.320 --> 00:14:27.320
A summoner, eh?

00:14:27.320 --> 00:14:28.410
In that case...

00:14:28.410 --> 00:14:32.450
I cut down this knight
and that will be the end!

00:14:40.460 --> 00:14:43.210
Now there is no knight
to protect the princess.

00:14:43.210 --> 00:14:44.420
Mira!

00:14:50.590 --> 00:14:53.100
"Immortal Arts, Heaven:
Refined Thrust"

00:14:56.640 --> 00:15:03.150
Hm, my reach is shorter, but it's become
easier to slip into the enemy's pocket.

00:15:03.150 --> 00:15:06.070
It's my first time in close-quarter
combat in this form,

00:15:06.070 --> 00:15:08.110
but perhaps I can manage.

00:15:08.110 --> 00:15:10.910
You bastard... what did you do?

00:15:10.910 --> 00:15:12.870
It was a mere tap.

00:15:12.870 --> 00:15:15.870
Nothing to get upset about,
you sniveling brat.

00:15:15.870 --> 00:15:18.160
That just now, no way...

00:15:18.160 --> 00:15:19.660
Immortal Arts?

00:15:19.660 --> 00:15:22.830
Don't get carried away, little girl!

00:15:27.590 --> 00:15:29.010
Compared to when this was a game,

00:15:29.010 --> 00:15:33.090
I can sense the presence of things and
the flow of air with my whole being.

00:15:33.090 --> 00:15:34.510
At this rate...

00:15:37.810 --> 00:15:39.310
You have my gratitude.

00:15:39.310 --> 00:15:42.270
I think I can get back into the
swing of things, thanks to you.

00:15:42.270 --> 00:15:45.270
You impertinent little thing!

00:15:53.160 --> 00:15:55.160
"Immortal Arts, Earth:
Crimson Bouquet"

00:15:59.330 --> 00:16:03.420
As I suspected,
only spells can get through.

00:16:03.420 --> 00:16:06.170
In that case, I think it's
about time I got serious.

00:16:06.170 --> 00:16:08.670
"Immortal Hidden Arts:
True Sight"

00:16:12.380 --> 00:16:13.220
What?

00:16:13.220 --> 00:16:15.430
Flicker? What's wrong?

00:16:15.430 --> 00:16:18.430
The aura around Mira has changed.

00:16:18.430 --> 00:16:22.100
Something even stronger and deeper...

00:16:33.200 --> 00:16:35.450
"Immortal Arts, Earth:
Enveloping Gale"

00:16:50.380 --> 00:16:53.590
Rot away, little girl!

00:16:54.930 --> 00:16:56.470
I refuse!

00:17:05.020 --> 00:17:07.270
"Immortal Arts, Movement:
Air Step"

00:17:13.650 --> 00:17:15.660
"Immortal Arts, Earth:
Raging Strike"

00:17:19.370 --> 00:17:21.870
D-Did she do it?

00:17:21.870 --> 00:17:24.250
No... not yet!

00:17:24.250 --> 00:17:28.880
It has no effect on me! I don't feel it!

00:17:28.880 --> 00:17:34.840
I've trained my body so it can
take an attack like that!

00:17:34.840 --> 00:17:36.890
You really are tough.

00:17:36.890 --> 00:17:40.220
However, let us end this soon.

00:17:44.930 --> 00:17:47.060
"Forbidden Immortal Arts:
Unsealed Demon's Eye"

00:17:47.230 --> 00:17:48.400
Impudence!

00:17:48.400 --> 00:17:50.860
You are but a human!

00:17:54.650 --> 00:17:57.360
Paralyzed? But...

00:17:59.240 --> 00:18:05.080
That's a demon for you.
It doesn't look like it'll hold for long.

00:18:05.080 --> 00:18:06.290
But...

00:18:09.460 --> 00:18:14.460
I told you at the beginning,
did I not? I'm a summoner.

00:18:18.930 --> 00:18:20.850
Bravo...

00:18:25.020 --> 00:18:26.600
Did she do it this time?

00:18:26.600 --> 00:18:28.690
Mira, that was great!

00:18:32.730 --> 00:18:35.360
Miss Mira, you were so cool!

00:18:35.360 --> 00:18:38.700
Yes, I was, wasn't I?

00:18:38.700 --> 00:18:41.370
You really saved us, Mira!

00:18:41.370 --> 00:18:44.740
Yeah, who knows what would've
happened if it'd been just us.

00:18:44.740 --> 00:18:46.910
I did nothing to deserve your thanks.

00:18:46.910 --> 00:18:50.290
I kind of dragged you
into this to begin with.

00:18:50.290 --> 00:18:52.170
So strong yet humble!

00:18:52.170 --> 00:18:54.880
That's the best part about you, Mira!

00:18:54.880 --> 00:18:58.970
But little miss, why are you so strong?

00:18:58.970 --> 00:19:03.430
Yeah. Not only can you summon,
but you also use the Immortal Arts...

00:19:03.430 --> 00:19:07.270
Plus, you're a freshly minted adventurer
and already at Rank C...

00:19:07.270 --> 00:19:11.310
Hm, so you do wonder about that...

00:19:11.310 --> 00:19:16.650
Well, with this lot, telling them
shouldn't be a problem.

00:19:16.650 --> 00:19:19.280
Do you know a person named Danblf?

00:19:19.280 --> 00:19:20.610
Of course!

00:19:20.610 --> 00:19:22.160
Also known as the One-Man Army,

00:19:22.160 --> 00:19:25.790
he's a legendary summoner
and one of the Nine Wise Men.

00:19:25.790 --> 00:19:28.710
There's no one in this kingdom
who doesn't know him.

00:19:28.710 --> 00:19:31.500
I love stories about the great Danblf!

00:19:31.500 --> 00:19:33.040
I see...

00:19:35.670 --> 00:19:38.760
I'm a pupil of that Danblf.

00:19:38.760 --> 00:19:42.140
Due to circumstances,
my mentor cannot move around now,

00:19:42.140 --> 00:19:43.890
so I'm taking care of
some things in his stead.

00:19:43.890 --> 00:19:47.640
I see. It totally makes sense
why you're so strong.

00:19:47.640 --> 00:19:50.440
The great Danblf had taken a pupil.

00:19:50.440 --> 00:19:53.100
I didn't know that. Right, Flicker?

00:19:53.100 --> 00:19:57.190
The great Danblf taking a pupil...

00:19:57.190 --> 00:20:00.570
It's unheard of for the
Nine Wise Men to take pupils!

00:20:00.570 --> 00:20:03.570
Your looks are incomparable, you're a
tremendously accomplished magic user,

00:20:03.570 --> 00:20:06.830
and add to that, you've got
this super special backstory?!

00:20:06.830 --> 00:20:09.160
You're making me even more
infatuated than I already was!

00:20:09.160 --> 00:20:11.250
--What are you trying to do to me, Mira?!

00:20:11.250 --> 00:20:12.290
--Well...
--What are you trying to do to me, Mira?!

00:20:12.290 --> 00:20:15.170
Still, this may sound
odd coming from me,

00:20:15.170 --> 00:20:18.050
but should you believe me so easily?

00:20:18.050 --> 00:20:22.930
Such a crazy story would usually
be met with more skepticism.

00:20:22.930 --> 00:20:26.260
You wouldn't tell a lie, Miss Mira.

00:20:26.260 --> 00:20:29.470
I mean, you helped us!

00:20:30.310 --> 00:20:31.850
Now that you mention it,

00:20:31.850 --> 00:20:34.270
the way you fought earlier

00:20:34.270 --> 00:20:38.400
is just like the story of Danblf
that my old man told me long ago!

00:20:38.400 --> 00:20:43.910
Right! He's a summoner, but even
when he fights himself he's very strong!

00:20:43.910 --> 00:20:45.280
You all...

00:20:45.280 --> 00:20:50.500
Danblf and the Nine Wise Men
once saved this kingdom.

00:20:50.500 --> 00:20:53.670
To us, they're legendary heroes.

00:20:53.670 --> 00:20:56.710
Therefore, as one of the Wise Men's pupil,

00:20:56.710 --> 00:21:01.920
I suppose you're kind of like
a hero reborn in Tact's eyes.

00:21:01.920 --> 00:21:03.880
I see...

00:21:03.880 --> 00:21:08.430
These people aren't NPCs after all.

00:21:08.430 --> 00:21:13.440
Each one has parents,
has memories of their childhood,

00:21:13.440 --> 00:21:15.940
and they are living in the now.

00:21:15.940 --> 00:21:19.690
We must protect this kingdom,

00:21:19.690 --> 00:21:21.780
mustn't we, Solomon?

00:21:25.070 --> 00:21:26.820
Ah, behold!

00:21:26.820 --> 00:21:30.540
Danblf, the One-Man Army,
chanted loud and clear

00:21:30.540 --> 00:21:33.910
and thousands of magic circles
appeared in the blue sky!

00:21:33.910 --> 00:21:35.580
Ba-bam!

00:21:35.580 --> 00:21:39.130
Is there still more to this story?

00:21:39.130 --> 00:21:40.420
What are you saying?

00:21:40.420 --> 00:21:44.220
"King Solomon and the Nine Wise Men"

00:21:40.420 --> 00:21:44.220
is just getting to the good part!

00:21:45.180 --> 00:21:50.390
I was stupid for casually saying
I wanted to hear it...

00:21:50.390 --> 00:21:54.430
Let's have a huge celebration
when we get into town tonight!

00:21:54.430 --> 00:21:57.650
Yeah, which place would be best?

00:21:59.270 --> 00:22:00.820
What is it?!

00:22:00.820 --> 00:22:03.190
Hey, that...

00:22:16.710 --> 00:22:18.120
This is...
